        <AlertDescription>
          <p>For detailed system requirements, see <a href="https://www.ibm.com/support/pages/linux-ibm-zibm-linuxone-tested-platforms">Linux on IBM Z(R)/IBM(R) LinuxONE tested platforms</a> (IBM Support).</p>
        </AlertDescription>
